1
00:00:00,776 --> 00:00:04,046
(Sheldon:)I don't see why not.

2
00:00:09,297 --> 00:00:11,467
(Bernadette:)He's eating.
That's a good sign.

3
00:00:11,466 --> 00:00:13,336
(Howard:)You're gonna have
to wait one hour

4
00:00:13,335 --> 00:00:15,665
(Howard:)until you can go swimming again.

5
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,140
(laughs)

6
00:00:17,139 --> 00:00:19,809
(Bernadette:)He's pretty cute.
He is.

7
00:00:19,808 --> 00:00:22,708
(Howard:)Should we... name him?

8
00:00:22,711 --> 00:00:24,781
(Bernadette:)It is Valentine's Day.

9
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,910
(Bernadette:)How about Valentino?

10
00:00:27,749 --> 00:00:30,889
(Howard:)Nice. A classic rabbit name.

11
00:00:30,886 --> 00:00:32,486
(both laugh)

12
00:00:32,487 --> 00:00:36,557
(Howard:)Peter Rabbit, Roger Rabbit.
Valentino Wolowitz Rabbit.

13
00:00:38,226 --> 00:00:40,956
(Howard:)Oh, look at all that
chest hair and overbite.

14
00:00:40,962 --> 00:00:42,732
(Howard:)Of course you're a Wolowitz.

15
00:00:42,731 --> 00:00:44,661
(both laugh)

16
00:00:44,666 --> 00:00:46,866
Son of a bitch! He bit me!

17
00:00:46,868 --> 00:00:48,768
(Bernadette:)Are you okay?

18
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,140
No, I'm not okay!

19
00:00:50,138 --> 00:00:52,038
(Howard:)Wild rabbits
can have rabies!

20
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:54,870
(Bernadette:)Oh. Well, why did you put
your finger near its mouth?

21
00:00:54,876 --> 00:00:57,706
Poor judgment, obviously.

